---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Policies & Forms"
  description="Team agreements, consent and release forms, and registration paperwork for families joining STEM+C robotics programs — Tie Dye Samurai (FRC) and Tie Dye Jedi (FTC)."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy text-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">Policies &amp; Forms</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-200 max-w-2xl">
        Everything a family signs, in one place — for both Tie Dye Samurai and Tie Dye Jedi.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-10">
        STEM+C is the 501(c)(3) nonprofit behind both robotics teams, so both teams use the same
        paperwork. There are <strong>two documents to sign</strong> — accepted once per season
        during registration — plus a privacy notice explaining what we do with your information.
        Every one of them can be read here or downloaded first.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Team Agreement -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-blue rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">Student &amp; Family Team Agreement</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                How we treat each other, what we expect around attendance and communication, shop and
                safety rules, and how dues and family participation work. Signed by the student
                <em>and</em> a parent or guardian.
              </p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
                Replaces the separate Student Code of Conduct, Student Contract, and Parent Contract
                used in earlier seasons.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/policies/team-agreement" class="inline-block bg-brand-blue text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors">
                  Read the agreement
                </a>
                <a href="/policies/stemplusc-team-agreement.pdf" download class="inline-block border-2 border-gray-300 text-navy px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:border-brand-blue transition-colors">
                  Download PDF
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Consent & Release -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-purple rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">Consent, Assumption of Risk, Release &amp; Emergency Authorization</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                Description of program hazards, assumption of risk, release of claims, safety
                obligations, emergency medical authorization, and an optional media choice. Signed
                by a parent or guardian for any participant under 18.
              </p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">
                Please read this one carefully — it describes real hazards and affects legal rights.
                The media choice is optional and is <strong>not</strong> a condition of
                participation.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/policies/consent-release" class="inline-block bg-brand-purple text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-900 transition-colors">
                  Read the agreement
                </a>
                <a href="/policies/stemplusc-consent-release.pdf" download class="inline-block border-2 border-gray-300 text-navy px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:border-brand-purple transition-colors">
                  Download PDF
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Privacy notice -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-2">Privacy Notice</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                What we collect about students and families, why, how long we keep it, and who can
                see it. Nothing to sign — this one is for you to read.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/policies/privacy" class="inline-block bg-navy text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-900 transition-colors">
                  Read the notice
                </a>
                <a href="/policies/stemplusc-privacy-notice.pdf" download class="inline-block border-2 border-gray-300 text-navy px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:border-navy transition-colors">
                  Download PDF
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FIRST forms note -->
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-brand-blue p-6 rounded-r-lg mt-10">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">These are in addition to <em>FIRST</em>'s own forms</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Every student on an FRC or FTC team also completes <em>FIRST</em>'s consent and release
          through the <a href="https://www.firstinspires.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">FIRST</a> registration
          system, separately from anything on this page. Your coach will walk you through it — it is
          required before a student can compete.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- How signing works -->
      <div class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">How signing works</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Families accept both documents during team registration — there is nothing to print, scan,
          or mail. Your coach sends the registration link when a student joins.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          The PDFs above are the same documents you will sign, so you can read them, keep them, or
          go through them with your student in advance. We would rather you signed something you had
          already read.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          If you need a copy of something you have already signed, or you would rather complete the
          paperwork on paper, email
          <a href="mailto:info@stemplusc.org" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline">info@stemplusc.org</a>
          and we will sort it out.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
